{"id": "EUVD-2026-59463", "enisaUuid": "b4fc3685-2b36-3ba1-b5c2-e3a6c9cc5236", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nNFSD: Handle layout stid in nfsd4_drop_revoked_stid()\n\nnfsd4_drop_revoked_stid() has no SC_TYPE_LAYOUT case, so when a\nclient sends FREE_STATEID for an admin-revoked layout stid, the\ndefault branch releases cl_lock and returns without unhashing or\nreleasing the stid.  The stid remains in the IDR and on the\nper-client list until the client is destroyed.\n\nRemove the layout stid from the per-client list and call\nnfs4_put_stid() to drop the creation reference.  When the\nrefcount reaches zero, nfsd4_free_layout_stateid() handles the\nremaining cleanup: cancelling the fence worker, removing from\nthe per-file list, and freeing the slab object.", "datePublished": "2026-08-15T05:58:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T18:55:32", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7ed62f7040ee182cf7dea5798f9e114235b31dae", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/da6f86ff4f2dd490bea52419a49e19680efd5847", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8024028ef91616cf91cc669f2446a0406bc0ba19", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/86b9898920a6d02b4149f4fef9efd77b8aa3b9ca"], "aliases": ["GHSA-2mq4-hj52-9fc6", "CVE-2026-74316"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.63, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0017e29e-20bd-3d98-a14f-cfad1fa1cf2d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.40"}, {"id": "070f63da-b5ac-3ffb-aa5b-7a9bf5db3050", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.97"}, {"id": "135db938-7a7a-35f5-b6f4-7ebb9b5434f7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1e33e1414bec54a4feafa9e67e2617031be0afe2 <7ed62f7040ee182cf7dea5798f9e114235b31dae"}, {"id": "2096d5d0-0240-3a65-857e-c456bd8c1933", "product": 